Cell["\<\
Now define a coefficient \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]field\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
that can be used with the above Clifford algebra. For example, define \
coefficients that are are multiplied by CommutattveProduct.\
\>", "Text",
 Editable->True,
 TaggingRules->{},
