Cell["\<\
The StandardForm notation \[CommutativeProduct] (unicode char  :0x26ab) is \
defined my modifying  UnicodeSymbols.tr file. Here we also determine  the \
operation precedence, which is 459. 
The following properties defined for arbitrary elements:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9591383449524612`*^9, 3.959138458426982*^9}, {
   3.9591389519626913`*^9, 3.959138984645249*^9}, {3.959139168270685*^9, 
